---
source: crates/rune-cli/tests/limits.rs
description: a config holding a loop that never ends
expression: "redact(test.dir(), &stderr_of(&output))"
---
rune.config.ts did not finish being evaluated within 250 ms

rune evaluates a config to completion before any script starts, so work that waits or loops without end never finishes and no rune command in this repository can run.

set RUNE_CONFIG_TIME_LIMIT_MS higher for a config that genuinely needs longer.
